    <ferc:StatementAboutImportantChangesDuringTheQuarterYearTextBlock id="f-334" contextRef="c-74">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: medium; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal; margin-bottom: 0; margin-left: 0.5in"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;In 2025, FERC has accepted the following filings:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: medium; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;a) Participating Transmission Owner Tarriff (&amp;quot;TO Tarriff), TRR and TRBAA&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: medium; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal"&gt;&lt;li style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;On December 1, 2025, Morongo submitted its TO Tarriff with the True-Up mechanism to reflect the Annual operating Cost Transmission Revenue Requirement (TRR) update in for its leasehold interest in the Project (exclusive of SCE billed) amounting to $13,102,160 to become effective January 1, 2026 in Docket ER26-642-000. The amount comprises $12,057,545 in SCE operating costs and $1,044,615 in managing and administering its Transfer Capability. The proposed Base TRR FY2026 amounts to $50,323,829.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; text-align: inherit"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; background-color: unset; text-align: inherit"&gt;On December 2, 2025,  the TRBAA update was filed in ER26-634-000, increasing the TRR by $5,252,393. The final TRR effective for rate year 2026 is $55,576,222 per the letter order issued in Docket No. ER26-634-000 issued on April 9, 2026, effective for service rendered on or after January 1, 2026&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:StatementAboutImportantChangesDuringTheQuarterYearTextBlock>
    <ferc:DisclosureOfAcquisitionOfOwnershipInOtherCompaniesByReorganizationMergerOrConsolidationWithOtherCompaniesTextBlock id="f-335" contextRef="c-74">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Until June 18, 2024, Morongo Band had a 51% interest in the Company and the remaining 49% was with Coachella Partners LLC (&amp;quot;Coachella Partners&amp;quot;). Axium Infrastructure US Inc. (the &amp;quot;Manager&amp;quot;) had been appointed as the manager of Coachella Partners, Axium Coachella Holdings LLC (&amp;quot;Axium Coachella&amp;quot;) and the Company. Refer to Note 9 for further details on the Company organizational structure.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;On June 18, 2024, The Morongo Band executed a Member Interest Purchase Agreement and Contribution Agreement to buyout Coachella's Partners LLC indirect 49% interests in Morongo Transmission through subsidiary Morongo Transmission Holdings LLC, which wholly consolidates Morongo Transmission LLC. Following the transaction, 100% of the interest in Morongo Transmission will be directly and indirectly owned by the Morongo Band.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Morongo Transmission LLC's docket application EC24-72-000 for FERC approval of the transfer was approved on June 13, 2024.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfAcquisitionOfOwnershipInOtherCompaniesByReorganizationMergerOrConsolidationWithOtherCompaniesTextBlock>
    <ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock id="f-336" contextRef="c-74">&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="Section_1" style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small"&gt; 			&lt;div style="clear: both; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small"&gt; 				&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 6%; font-size: small; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="clear: both; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small"&gt;&lt;div&gt;  &lt;p style="margin: 0.95pt 0 0; font-size: 10pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt; 			&lt;/div&gt; 		&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="Section_1"&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.95pt; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;The accompanying financial statements were prepared in accordance with the accounting requirements of the Federal Energy Regulatory Commission (FERC) as set forth in its applicable Uniform System of Accounts and published accounting releases, which is a comprehensive basis of accounting other than U.S. generally accepted accounting principles (U.S. GAAP). Accordingly, certain footnotes are not prepared on the same basis as the financial statements presented herein as the Notes to the Financial Statements set forth below are principally from the Company's audited December 31, 2024 and 2023 U.S. GAAP Financial Statements.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.95pt; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.95pt; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;The primary differences between the Company's FERC financial statements and U.S. GAAP financial statements are:&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.95pt; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.95pt; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;(1) There is no current liability classification of the current portion of long-term debt; and deferred financing costs are reported separately in the FERC balance sheets;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.95pt; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.95pt; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;(2) Deferred financing costs are amortized using a different amortization method (Note 8);&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.95pt; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.95pt; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;(3) There is no current classification of the current portion of regulatory assets and regulatory liability;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.95pt; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.95pt; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;(4) The presentation of Transfer Capability regulatory assets and the capitalized transaction costs and financing costs in the balance sheets under U.S. GAAP requirements differs from FERC requirements (Note 6);&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.95pt; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.95pt; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;(5) The inclusion of income taxes as a component of the FERC financial statements pursuant to the FERC's Policy Statement on Income Tax Allowances, rather than the exclusion of income taxes pursuant to U.S. GAAP due to the Company's treatment as a flow through entity&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.95pt; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.95pt; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;(Note 11); and&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.95pt; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.95pt; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;(6) A portion of Member's equity for U.S. GAAP reporting purposes is included in Accumulated Deferred Income Taxes for FERC reporting purposes. However, the Members pay income taxes on their allocated share of the Company's income and for purposes herein, those taxes are calculated using the federal corporate rate (Note 11).&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.95pt; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.95pt; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;1. Organization:&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;h2 style="margin-top: 0; margin-left: 28.65pt; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/h2&gt; 			&lt;h2 style="margin-top: 0; margin-left: 28.65pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-indent: -17.9pt; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.05pt"&gt;(1)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 5.68pt; font: 7pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;Organization&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/h2&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin: 5.55pt 27.7pt 0 28.75pt; line-height: 104%; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;Morongo Transmission LLC (the &amp;quot;Company&amp;quot; or &amp;quot;Morongo&amp;quot;), a Delaware limited liability company, was formed on November 21, 2012 for the sole purpose of exercising the option to lease a portion of the transfer capability in the Federal Energy Regulatory Commission (&amp;quot;FERC&amp;quot;)-regulated West of Devers Transmission&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Upgrade&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Project&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;(the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;quot;Project&amp;quot;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;from&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;South&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;California&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.25pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Edison&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;(&amp;quot;SCE&amp;quot;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;in&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;southern&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;California (the &amp;quot;Option&amp;quot;).&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin: 10.15pt 21.1pt 0 28.75pt; line-height: 104%; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;At the time SCE began planning for the Project, it occupied a 300-foot wide, six-mile expired right-of-way on the Morongo Band of Mission Indians' Reservation (&amp;quot;Reservation&amp;quot;), pursuant to temporary licenses issued by the Morongo Band of Mission Indians (the &amp;quot;Morongo Band&amp;quot;). SCE requested that the Morongo Band grant SCE an expanded 50-year, six-mile, right-of-way in the existing transmission corridor through the Reservation to construct the Project. The Morongo Band agreed to the grant if SCE allowed them to participate&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;in&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.25pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Project&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;by&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;providing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Company&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;with&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;an&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;option&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;to&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;lease&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;a&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;section&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Project&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;for $400 million, in the form of prepaid rent, to be allocated over the lease term.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin: 10.35pt 27.7pt 0 28.75pt; line-height: 104%; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;The&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Project&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;consists&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;approximatively&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;48&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;corridor&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.05pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;miles&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;new&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;220kV&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;transmission&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;lines&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;crossing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;the Reservation. The Company exercised its Option to lease a portion of such Transfer Capability for a duration&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;30&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;years&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;on&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;July&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;12,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;2021,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;by&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;disbursing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;a&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;total&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$400&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;million,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;financed&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;by&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;long-term&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;debt.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin: 10.15pt 18.7pt 0 28.75pt; line-height: 104%; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;The Company is a Participating Transmission Owner (&amp;quot;PTO&amp;quot;) of the California Independent System Operator&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;(&amp;quot;CAISO&amp;quot;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;has&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;placed&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;under&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;CAISO's&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;operational&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;control&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;all&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;its&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;interest&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;in&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;leased portion&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;transmission&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;line&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.05pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;on&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.05pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.05pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;same&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.05pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;date&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.05pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Option&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.05pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;was&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.05pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;exercised.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Morongo&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.05pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;is&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.05pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;subject&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.05pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;to&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.05pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;the jurisdiction of the FERC.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin: 10.1pt 18.7pt 0 28.75pt; line-height: 104%; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;Until June 18, 2024, Morongo Band had a 51% interest in the Company and the remaining 49% was with Coachella Partners LLC (&amp;quot;Coachella Partners&amp;quot;). Axium Infrastructure US Inc. (the &amp;quot;Manager&amp;quot;) had been appointed&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;as&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;manager&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.25pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Coachella&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Partners,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Axium&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Coachella&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.25pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Holdings&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;LLC&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;(&amp;quot;Axium&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.25pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Coachella&amp;quot;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;and the Company. Refer to Note 9 for further details on the Company organizational structure.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin: 10.2pt 18.7pt 0 28.75pt; line-height: 104%; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;On&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;June&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;18,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;2024,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;The&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.05pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Morongo&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.05pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Band&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.05pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;executed&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.05pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;a&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Member&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.05pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Interest&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.05pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Purchase&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Agreement&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.05pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Contribution Agreement to buy out Coachella's Partners LLC indirect 49% interests in Morongo Transmission through subsidiary Morongo Transmission Holdings LLC, which wholly consolidates Morongo Transmission LLC. Following&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;transaction,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.25pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;100%&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;interest&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;in&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Morongo&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Transmission&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;is&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;directly&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;indirectly&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;owned&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;by the Morongo Band.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin: 10.2pt 18.7pt 0 28.75pt; line-height: 104%; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;Morongo&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Transmission&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;LLC's&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;docket&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;application&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;EC24-72-000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;for&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.25pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;FERC&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;approval&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;transfer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;was approved on June 13, 2024.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;h2 style="margin-top: 10.05pt; margin-left: 28.65pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-indent: -17.9pt; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.05pt"&gt;(2)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 5.68pt; font: 7pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Significant&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Accounting&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;Policies&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/h2&gt; 			&lt;h3 style="margin-top: 5.55pt; margin-left: 46.65pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-indent: -17.9pt; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic; letter-spacing: -0.05pt"&gt;(a)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 5.68pt; font: 7pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic"&gt;Basis&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic; letter-spacing: -0.3pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic"&gt;of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic; letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt; presentation&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/h3&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 5.5pt; margin-left: 46.8pt; margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 104%; font-size: 10pt"&gt;The Morongo Transmission accounting procedures will follow the FERC Uniform System of Accounts (&amp;quot;USOA&amp;quot;), including the instructions contained therein. The Company accounting procedures will also follow Generally Accepted Accounting Principles (&amp;quot;GAAP&amp;quot;).&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 5.5pt; margin-left: 46.8pt; margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 104%; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;h3 style="margin-top: 0; margin-left: 46.7pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-indent: -17.95pt; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic; letter-spacing: -0.05pt"&gt;(b)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 5.18pt; font: 7pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic"&gt;Use&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic; letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic"&gt;of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic; letter-spacing: -0.05pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic; letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;estimates&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/h3&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin: 5.55pt 18.7pt 0 46.8pt; line-height: 104%; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;The preparation of financial statements in conformity with US GAAP requires management to make estimates and assumptions that affect the reported amounts of assets and liabilities, disclosure of contingent assets and liabilities at the date of the financial statements, and the reported amounts of revenues and expenses during the reporting period. Management evaluates its estimates and assumptions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.25pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;on&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;an&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;ongoing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;basis&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;using&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.25pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;historical&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;experience&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;other&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;factors,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;such&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;as&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;economic environment. Actual results could differ from those estimates.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin: 10.2pt 18.7pt 0 46.8pt; line-height: 104%; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;Included&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;in&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;significant&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;estimates&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;significant&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;assumptions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;made&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;by&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;management&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;is&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;amortization of the annual Transmission Revenue Requirement (&amp;quot;TRR&amp;quot;), the regulatory assets and liabilities based on recovery through TRR rate and the accrued interests on regulatory assets and liabilities.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;h3 style="margin-top: 10.15pt; margin-left: 46.65pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-indent: -17.9pt; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic; letter-spacing: -0.05pt"&gt;(c)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 5.68pt; font: 7pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic"&gt;Revenue&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic; letter-spacing: -0.3pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic; letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;recognition&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/h3&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin: 5.5pt 27.7pt 0 46.8pt; line-height: 104%; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;The&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Company's&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.25pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;revenue&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;is&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;established&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;by&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;FERC-approved&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;annual&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;TRR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;is&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;paid&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;by&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;CAISO,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;its only customer, on a monthly basis. The totality of the revenue is contractual with CAISO and the Company recognizes revenue in accordance with ASC 606. The TRR monthly income is recognized when the right to receive payments is established and records a trade receivable at the end of the month for the month incurred as CAISO pays a month in arrears. The annual TRR is amortized on a straight-line basis. Refer to Note 10 for more information.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;h3 style="margin-top: 10.25pt; margin-left: 46.7pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-indent: -17.95pt; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic; letter-spacing: -0.05pt"&gt;(d)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 5.18pt; font: 7pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic"&gt;Income&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic; letter-spacing: -0.3pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic; letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;taxes&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/h3&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin: 5.5pt 18.7pt 0 46.8pt; line-height: 104%; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;The Company is a wholly owned limited liability company that is disregarded for income tax purposes. As a result of its disregarded entity status, the Company is not liable for federal or state income taxes. The Company is allowed, however, to recover in rates, as a component of its cost of service, an allowance for income taxes and is required to adjust its rate base by the amounts of deferred income tax assets and liabilities that it would have recorded if it were a taxable entity. As such, pursuant to FERC's Policy Statement on Income Tax Allowances and ratemaking precedent accounting orders, the Company has included a provision for federal and state income taxes in its statements of income, deferred taxes on its statements of cash flows and accumulated deferred income taxes and taxes accrued in its balance sheets in this report. The Company settles accrued income taxes as a deemed capital contribution from or deemed distribution to its owner.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin: 5.5pt 18.7pt 0 46.8pt; line-height: 104%; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;The Company accounts for income taxes under the assets and liability method, which requires the recognition of deferred tax assets and liabilities for the expected future tax consequences of events that have been included in the financial statements. Under this method, deferred tax assets and liabilities are recognized for temporary differences between the financial statement basis and tax basis of assets and liabilities using enacted tax rates applicable to for the year(s) in which the temporary differences are expected to reverse. In general, deferred income tax expense or benefit for a reporting period is recognized as the change in deferred tax assets and liabilities from the beginning to the end of the period.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin: 5.5pt 18.7pt 0 46.8pt; line-height: 104%; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;The effects of tax positions are recognized in the financial statements when it is more likely than not that the position taken, or expected to be taken, in a tax return will be sustained upon examination by taxing authorities based on the technical merits of the position. The effects of changes in tax laws or rates on deferred tax assets and liabilities are recognized in the period of enactment and the timing of recognition of the effects of such changes on income tax expense depends on applicable Commission orders.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin: 5.5pt 18.7pt 0 46.8pt; line-height: 104%; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;The Company, in accordance with ASC 740, Income Taxes, performs the evaluation of tax positions taken or expected to be taken in the course of preparing the Company's tax returns to determine whether the tax positions are &amp;quot;more likely than not&amp;quot; of being sustained by the applicable tax authority. Tax positions not deemed to meet the more likely than not threshold would be derecognized and recorded as a tax benefit or expense in the current year. However, the Company's conclusions regarding these uncertain tax positions will be subject to review and may be adjusted at a later date based on fa tors including, but not limited to, ongoing analysis of tax laws, regulations and interpretations thereof.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin: 5.5pt 18.7pt 0 46.8pt; line-height: 104%; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;The Company recognizes regulatory assets or liabilities for deferred taxes in certain circumstances in accordance with the applicable ratemaking and ASC 980-740.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin: 5.5pt 18.7pt 0 46.8pt; line-height: 104%; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;Refer to Note 11 for further details.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;h3 style="margin-top: 10.25pt; margin-left: 46.65pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-indent: -17.9pt; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic; letter-spacing: -0.05pt"&gt;(e)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 5.68pt; font: 7pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic"&gt;Restricted&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic; letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt; cash&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/h3&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin: 5.5pt 27.7pt 0 46.8pt; line-height: 104%; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;Morongo's&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;financing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;agreement,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;collateral&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;agency&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;security&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.25pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;agreement&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;(the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;quot;CASA&amp;quot;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;requires the Company to establish and maintain segregated cash accounts, the use of which is restricted.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin: 10.1pt 27.7pt 0 46.8pt; line-height: 104%; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;These&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;amounts&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;are&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;held&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;in&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;order&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;to&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;comply&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;with&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;contractual&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;provisions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;long-term&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;debt requiring reserves for payments such as for debt service and the payments to the Company's &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;suppliers.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;h3 style="margin-top: 10.15pt; margin-left: 46.7pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-indent: -17.95pt; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic; letter-spacing: -0.05pt"&gt;(f)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 7.96pt; font: 7pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic"&gt;Deferred&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic; letter-spacing: -0.25pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic"&gt;financing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic; letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic; letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;costs&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/h3&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin: 5.5pt 18.7pt 0 46.8pt; line-height: 104%; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;Deferred financing costs consist of financial fees and closing costs incurred by the Company in obtaining its financing. A portion of these financing costs are presented on the balance sheet as a reduction from the carrying amount of that debt and amortization of the deferred financing costs is recorded as interest expense in accordance with GAAP. The costs are being amortized using the effective&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;interest&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;method&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;over&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;life&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.25pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;related&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;debt&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;are&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;recorded&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;in&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Interests&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;expense&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;on&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin: 0 18.7pt 0 46.8pt; line-height: 104%; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;long-term&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;debt&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;account&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;on&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Statements&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Operations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;The&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;remaining&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;portion&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;financing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;costs have been capitalized as a regulatory asset.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;h3 style="margin-top: 10.1pt; margin-left: 46.7pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-indent: -17.95pt; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic; letter-spacing: -0.05pt"&gt;(g)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 5.18pt; font: 7pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic"&gt;Transaction&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic; letter-spacing: -0.45pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic; letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;costs:&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/h3&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin: 5.5pt 18.7pt 0 46.8pt; line-height: 104%; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;Transaction costs consist of legal fees and closing costs incurred by the Company in exercising the Option. A portion of those&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.05pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;costs have been included&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.05pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;in the Capital&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Cost Revenue Requirement part of the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;TRR,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;which&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;will&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;be&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;recovered&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;across&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;30-year&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;term&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;remaining&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;portion&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;transaction costs have been capitalized as a regulatory asset.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;h3 style="margin-top: 10.2pt; margin-left: 46.7pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-indent: -17.95pt; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic; letter-spacing: -0.05pt"&gt;(h)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 5.18pt; font: 7pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic"&gt;Rate&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic; letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic"&gt;regulated&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic; letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic; letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;entity:&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/h3&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin: 5.45pt 18.7pt 0 46.8pt; line-height: 104%; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;We account for our regulated operations in accordance with the authoritative guidance applicable to entities with regulated operations that meet the following criteria: (i) rates are established or approved by an independent, third-party regulator; (ii) rates are designed to recover the entity's specific costs of providing the regulated services or products and; (iii) there is a reasonable expectation that rates are set&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;at&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;levels&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;that&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;will&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;recover&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;entity's&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;costs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;can&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;be&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;collected&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;from&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;customers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Regulatory&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;assets represent incurred costs that have been deferred because of their probable future recovery from customers through regulated rates. Regulatory liabilities represent: (i) the excess recovery of costs or accrued credits that have been deferred because it is probable such amounts will be returned to customers through future regulated rates; or (ii) billings in advance of expenditures for approved regulatory programs.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin: 10.45pt 18.15pt 0 46.8pt; line-height: 104%; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;We amortize regulatory assets and liabilities and recognize the related expense or revenue in our Statements&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Operations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.25pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;consistent&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;with&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;recovery&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;or&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;refund&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;included&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;in&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;customer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;rates.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.25pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;We&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;believe it is probable that our currently recorded regulatory assets and liabilities will be recovered or settled in future rates.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 10.2pt; margin-left: 46.8pt; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;For&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.25pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;its&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;portion&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Transfer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Capability,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;TRR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;is&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;subject&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;to&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;approval&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;by&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt; FERC.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin: 10.45pt 32pt 0 46.8pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 104%; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;The&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Participating&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.25pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Transmission&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Owner's&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Transmission&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.25pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Revenue&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Requirement&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.25pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;(&amp;quot;PTO's&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;TRR&amp;quot;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;are&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;the regulated rates billed to CAISO.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.05pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;They are designed to recover the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;specific entity's costs of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.05pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;providing the regulated services. The TRR is composed of two elements:&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin: 10.15pt 22.95pt 0 64.8pt; text-indent: -18.05pt; line-height: 104%; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic; letter-spacing: -0.05pt"&gt;(i)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 9.07pt; font: 7pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic"&gt;Annual Capital Costs Revenue Requirement - &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;which includes a hypothetical capital structure of 50%&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.3pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;debt&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.35pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.3pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;50%&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.25pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;equity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.3pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.3pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;a&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.3pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;30-year&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.3pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;levelized&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.3pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;capital&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.4pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;recovery&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.3pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;approach.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.35pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;It&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.3pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;is&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.3pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;calculated&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.35pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;based on Morongo's annual capital costs of using the Transfer Capability and is inclusive of SCE's authorized Return on Equity (&amp;quot;ROE&amp;quot;).&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 10.2pt; margin-left: 64.75pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-indent: -17.95pt; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic"&gt;(ii)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 6.85pt; font: 7pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic"&gt;Annual&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic; letter-spacing: -0.7pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic"&gt;Operating&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic; letter-spacing: -0.6pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic"&gt;Costs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic; letter-spacing: -0.5pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic"&gt;Revenue&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic; letter-spacing: -0.6pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic"&gt;Requirement&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic; letter-spacing: -0.55pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic"&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic; letter-spacing: -0.5pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;which&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.5pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;includes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.55pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;two&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.55pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;elements:&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin: 10.45pt 25.65pt 0 82.8pt; text-indent: -18pt; line-height: 104%; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&lt;span&gt;1.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 9.56pt; font: 7pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Morongo's&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;monthly&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.4pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;share&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.45pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.45pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.4pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;annual&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.55pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Operations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.35pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.4pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Maintenance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.4pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;(O&amp;amp;M)-related&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.4pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;costs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.35pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;that is incurred by SCE. This expense amount will be updated annually through the SCE's O&amp;amp;M formula rate.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 10.15pt; margin-left: 82.7pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-indent: -17.9pt; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&lt;span&gt;2.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 9.56pt; font: 7pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;The&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.7pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;costs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.6pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;incurred&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.6pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;directly&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.45pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;by&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.5pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Morongo&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.5pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;in&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.45pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;managing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.45pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.6pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;administering&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.5pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;its&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.55pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Transfer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.55pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;Capability.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.95pt; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin: 0 18.15pt 0 46.8pt; line-height: 104%; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;Regulatory assets represent probable future revenue associated with certain costs or liabilities that have&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;been&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;deferred&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;are&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;expected&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;to&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;be&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;recovered&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.25pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;from&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;customers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;through&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;ratemaking&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;process.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin: 10.1pt 27.7pt 0 46.8pt; line-height: 104%; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;Regulatory&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;liabilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;represent&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;amounts&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;that&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;are&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;expected&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;to&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;be&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;refunded&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;to&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;customers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;in&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;future&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;rates or amounts collected in rates for future costs.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin: 10.1pt 18.15pt 0 46.8pt; line-height: 104%; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;Recovery or refund of regulatory assets and liabilities occurs over the normal operating period of the assets&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;liabilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;to&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;which&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;they&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;relate.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;If&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;at&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;any&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;reporting&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;date&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;a&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;previously&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;recorded&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;regulatory&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;asset is&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;no&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;longer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;probable&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;recovery,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;regulatory&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;asset&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;is&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;reduced&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;to&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;amount&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;considered&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;probable&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;of recovery with the reduction charged to expense in the year the determination is made.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 10.15pt; margin-left: 46.8pt; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;Refer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;to&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Notes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;4&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.05pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;12&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;for&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;more&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.05pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;information.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;h3 style="margin-top: 10.5pt; margin-left: 46.7pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-indent: -17.95pt; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic"&gt;(i)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 8.51pt; font: 7pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic"&gt;Fair&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic; letter-spacing: -0.25pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic"&gt;value&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic; letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic; letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;measurements:&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/h3&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin: 5.5pt 21.75pt 0 46.8pt; line-height: 104%; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;Fair value, as defined in ASC 820, Fair Value Measurement and Disclosures (ASC 820), is the price that would be received to sell an asset or paid to transfer a liability in an orderly transaction between market participants at the measurement date (exit price). The Company uses valuation approaches that&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;maximize&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;use&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;observable&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;inputs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;minimize&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;use&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;unobservable&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;inputs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;to&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;extent possible. The Company determines fair value based on assumptions that market participants would use in pricing an asset or liability in the principal or most advantageous market. When considering market participant assumptions in fair value measurements, the following fair value hierarchy distinguishes between observable and unobservable inputs, which are categorized in one of the following levels:&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin: 9.9pt 63.2pt 0 64.8pt; text-indent: -18.05pt; line-height: 103%; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Symbol"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 13.45pt; font: 7pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Level&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.35pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.4pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;inputs:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.4pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Unadjusted&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.35pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;quoted&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.35pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;prices&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.4pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;in&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.3pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;active&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.3pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;markets&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.3pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;for&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.3pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;identical&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.3pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;assets&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.35pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;or&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.3pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;liabilities accessible to the reporting entity at the measurement date&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin: 4.7pt 21pt 0 64.8pt; text-indent: -18.05pt; line-height: 103%; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Symbol"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 13.45pt; font: 7pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Level&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.25pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.3pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;inputs:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.4pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Other&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.3pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;than&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;quoted&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.3pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;prices&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.3pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;included&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;in&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.3pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Level&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.3pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.25pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;inputs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.3pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;that&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.3pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;are&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.3pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;observable&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.25pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;for&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.3pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.35pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;asset or liability, either directly or indirectly, for substantially the full term of the asset or liability.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin: 4.7pt 20.5pt 0 64.8pt; text-indent: -18.05pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 104%; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Symbol"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 13.45pt; font: 7pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Level&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.25pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;3&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.3pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;inputs:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.4pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Unobservable&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.25pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;inputs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.3pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;for&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.3pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.35pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;asset&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.25pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;or&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.3pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;liability&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.35pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;used&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.3pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;to&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.3pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;measure&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.3pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;fair&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.4pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;value&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.3pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;to&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.25pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.25pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;extent that&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.3pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;observable&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.25pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;inputs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.3pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;are&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.3pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;not&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.35pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;available,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.45pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;thereby&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.3pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;allowing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.25pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;for&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.3pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;situations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;in&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.4pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;which&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.25pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;there&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.3pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;is&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;little,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.35pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;if&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;any, market activity for the asset or liability at measurement date.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;h3 style="margin-top: 10.05pt; margin-left: 46.7pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-indent: -17.95pt; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic; letter-spacing: -0.05pt"&gt;(j)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 8.51pt; font: 7pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic"&gt;Fair&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic; letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic"&gt;value&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic; letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic"&gt;of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic; letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic"&gt;financial&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic; letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic; letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;instruments:&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/h3&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin: 5.45pt 30.35pt 0 46.8pt; line-height: 104%; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;The&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;carrying&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;amount&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Trade&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;accounts&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.25pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;receivable,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;accounts&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;receivable&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;from&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;related&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;parties,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;prepaid expenses and accounts payable and accrued liabilities equals or approximates fair value due to the short-term maturity of those instruments.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;h3 style="margin-top: 10.15pt; margin-left: 46.65pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-indent: -17.9pt; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic; letter-spacing: -0.05pt"&gt;(k)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 5.68pt; font: 7pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic"&gt;Trade&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic; letter-spacing: -0.3pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic"&gt;accounts&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic; letter-spacing: -0.25pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic; letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;receivable:&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/h3&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin: 5.5pt 21.1pt 0 46.8pt; line-height: 104%; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;Trade accounts receivable are recorded at the regulated FERC-approved amount and do not bear interest. Amounts collected on trade accounts receivable are included in net cash provided by operating activities in the Statements of Cash Flows. Due to the nature of the Company's only customer, CAISO, which is a governmental institution, and the nature of the low-risk contractual agreement&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;based&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;on&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;fixed&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.25pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;levelized&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;payments&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;throughout&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;30-years&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;lease&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;term,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;risk&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.25pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;financial losses and the impact of current market conditions are minimal.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.95pt; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin: 0 18.7pt 0 46.8pt; line-height: 104%; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;Therefore, the Company has not recorded an allowance for doubtful accounts for estimated losses inherent&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;in&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;its&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;accounts&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;receivable&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;portfolio&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;maintained&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;by&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Company.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;The&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Company&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;does&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;not&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;have any off-balance-sheet credit exposure related to its customers.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;h3 style="margin-top: 10.15pt; margin-left: 46.7pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-indent: -17.95pt; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic; letter-spacing: -0.05pt"&gt;(l)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 8.51pt; font: 7pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic"&gt;Commitments&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic; letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic"&gt;and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic; letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt; contingencies&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/h3&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin: 5.5pt 18.7pt 0 46.8pt; line-height: 104%; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;In accordance with ASC 450, the Company records a loss contingency for matters when it is probable that a liability has been incurred and the amount of the loss can be reasonably estimated. Loss contingency&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;reserves&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;are&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;based&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;on&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;estimates&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;judgments&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;made&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;by&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;management&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;with&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;respect&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;to&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;the likely outcome of matters, including any applicable insurance coverage for such matters and are adjusted as circumstances warrant. These estimates and judgments could change based on new information,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;changes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;in&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;laws&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;or&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;regulations,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;changes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;in&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;management's&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;plans&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;or&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;intentions,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;outcome of legal proceedings, settlements or other factors. However, it is to be noted that the Company is not subject to any contingencies as it is subject to refund by CAISO of the full amount regardless of whether the transmission line is in function or not due to it being a rate regulated entity and receiving approval from the FERC.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;h2 style="margin-top: 10.4pt; margin-left: 28.65pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-indent: -17.9pt; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.05pt"&gt;(3)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 5.68pt; font: 7pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Trade&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.35pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Accounts&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;Receivable&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/h2&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin: 5.45pt 18.7pt 0 28.75pt; line-height: 104%; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;As of December 31, 2025 and 2024, the Company carries its accounts receivable at the annual TO's TRR amounting&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;to&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$51,378,013&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.25pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$45,850,589&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;respectively,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;amortized&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;over&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;12-month&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;period.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;CAISO&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;pays the tariff to Morongo on a monthly basis, with a month in arrears. The amount of TRR income received within a given month by CAISO is compared to the amortized monthly expected amount as per the annual TO's TRR filed with FERC for the period from January 1 to December 31. The difference is recorded as an account&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;receivable&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;or&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;a&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;deferred&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;revenue.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;TRR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;revenue&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;is&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;recognized&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;when&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;right&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;to&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;receive&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;amount is established.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;h2 style="margin-top: 10.35pt; margin-left: 28.65pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-indent: -17.9pt; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.05pt"&gt;(4)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 5.68pt; font: 7pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Regulatory&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.25pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Assets&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.25pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;Liabilities&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/h2&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 5.45pt; margin-left: 28.75pt; margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 104%; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;Below&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;is&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;a&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;summary&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;mechanisms&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Morongo&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;has&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;in&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;place&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;that&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;allow&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Company&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;to&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;recover&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;or&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;refund changes in prudently incurred costs and revenue from rate case-approved amounts.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;h3 style="margin-top: 10.1pt; margin-left: 46.65pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-indent: -17.9pt; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic; letter-spacing: -0.05pt"&gt;(a)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 5.68pt; font: 7pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic"&gt;Regulatory&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic; letter-spacing: -0.45pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic; letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;assets&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/h3&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 5.5pt; margin-left: 64.8pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-indent: -19.7pt; page-break-after: avoid; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic"&gt;(i)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 10.82pt; font: 7pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic"&gt;Transmission&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic; letter-spacing: -0.4pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic"&gt;Revenue&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic; letter-spacing: -0.3pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic"&gt;Balancing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic; letter-spacing: -0.35pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic"&gt;Account&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic; letter-spacing: -0.35pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic; letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;(&amp;quot;TRBA&amp;quot;)&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.15pt; margin-bottom: 0; page-break-after: avoid; font-size: 5pt"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-style: italic"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;table cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="margin-left: 65.05pt; border-collapse: collapse" class="e-rte-table"&gt; 				&lt;tr style="height: 14.85pt"&gt; 					&lt;td colspan="3" style="width: 220.15pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; page-break-after: avoid; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 							&lt;span style="font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td colspan="2" style="width: 133.3pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: right; page-break-after: avoid; line-height: 10.8pt"&gt; 							&lt;span style="width: 26.9pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Lucida Console&amp;quot;; font-size: 9.5pt; font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 9.5pt; font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline; letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;2025&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 27.32pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Lucida Console&amp;quot;; font-size: 9.5pt; font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 81pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: right; page-break-after: avoid; line-height: 10.8pt"&gt; 							&lt;span style="width: 26.9pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Lucida Console&amp;quot;; font-size: 9.5pt; font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 9.5pt; font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline; letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;2024&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 27.32pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Lucida Console&amp;quot;; font-size: 9.5pt; font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="vertical-align: top"&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 				&lt;/tr&gt; 				&lt;tr style="height: 15.4pt"&gt; 					&lt;td style="vertical-align: top"&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 211.5pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 3.9pt; margin-left: 2.5pt; margin-bottom: 0; page-break-after: avoid; line-height: 10.55pt"&gt; 							&lt;span style="font-size: 9.5pt; letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;TRBA&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td colspan="2" style="width: 133.9pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 3.9pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: right; page-break-after: avoid; line-height: 10.55pt"&gt; 							&lt;span style="font-size: 9.5pt; letter-spacing: -0.5pt"&gt;$&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 9.5pt; letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;4,267,269&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 9.5pt; letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td colspan="3" style="width: 84.15pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 3.9pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: right; page-break-after: avoid; line-height: 10.55pt"&gt; 							&lt;span style="font-size: 9.5pt; letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;1,702,985&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 				&lt;/tr&gt; 				&lt;tr style="height: 12pt"&gt; 					&lt;td style="vertical-align: top"&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 211.5pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.45pt; margin-left: 2.5pt; margin-bottom: 0; page-break-after: avoid; line-height: 10.55pt"&gt; 							&lt;span style="font-size: 9.5pt"&gt;Accrued&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 9.5pt; letter-spacing: -0.55pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 9.5pt"&gt;interests&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 9.5pt; letter-spacing: -0.5pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 9.5pt"&gt;on&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 9.5pt; letter-spacing: -0.5pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 9.5pt; letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;TRBA&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td colspan="2" style="width: 133.9pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.45pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: right; page-break-after: avoid; line-height: 10.55pt"&gt; 							&lt;span style="font-size: 9.5pt; letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;308,078&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td colspan="3" style="width: 84.15pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.45pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: right; page-break-after: avoid; line-height: 10.55pt"&gt; 							&lt;span style="font-size: 9.5pt; letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;70,403&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 				&lt;/tr&gt; 				&lt;tr style="height: 15.15pt"&gt; 					&lt;td style="vertical-align: top"&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 211.5pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.45pt; margin-left: 2.5pt; margin-bottom: 0; page-break-after: avoid; font-size: 9.5pt"&gt; 							&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;TRBAA&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.35pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;Adjustment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.5pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;for&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: 0.05pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;2022-2024&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td colspan="2" style="width: 133.9pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.45pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: right; page-break-after: avoid; font-size: 9.5pt"&gt; 							&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;677,046&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td colspan="3" style="width: 84.15pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.45pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: right; page-break-after: avoid; font-size: 9.5pt"&gt; 							&lt;span style="width: 36pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Lucida Console&amp;quot;; text-decoration: underline; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline; letter-spacing: -0.5pt"&gt;--&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline; letter-spacing: 2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 				&lt;/tr&gt; 				&lt;tr style="height: 14.55pt"&gt; 					&lt;td style="vertical-align: top"&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 211.5pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 3.6pt; margin-left: 65.3pt; margin-bottom: 0; page-break-after: avoid; line-height: 9.95pt"&gt; 							&lt;span style="font-size: 9.5pt; letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;Regulatory&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 9.5pt; letter-spacing: 0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 9.5pt; letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;asset&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 9.5pt; letter-spacing: -0.45pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 9.5pt; letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;(liability)&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td colspan="2" style="width: 133.9pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 3.6pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: right; page-break-after: avoid; line-height: 9.95pt"&gt; 							&lt;span style="font-size: 9.5pt"&gt;$ &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 9.5pt; text-decoration: underline; letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;5,252,393&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td colspan="3" style="width: 84.15pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 3.6pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: right; page-break-after: avoid; line-height: 9.95pt"&gt; 							&lt;span style="width: 36pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Lucida Console&amp;quot;; font-size: 9.5pt; text-decoration: underline; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 9.5pt; text-decoration: underline; letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;1,773,388&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 				&lt;/tr&gt; 				&lt;tr style="height: 0"&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 6.95pt"&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 211.5pt"&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 1.7pt"&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 132.2pt"&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 1.1pt"&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 81pt"&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 2.05pt"&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 				&lt;/tr&gt; 			&lt;/table&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-style: italic"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin: 0 21.75pt 0 64.8pt; line-height: 104%; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;The purpose of the TRBA is to ensure that all transmission revenue credits and adjustments for any over-or under-recovery of its annual TRR of the CAISO tariff, flow through to transmission customers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;The&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;TRBA&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;mechanism&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;is&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;designed&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;to&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;ensure&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;that&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;a&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;PTO&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;does&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;not&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;receive&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;more&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;or&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;less revenue than its Commission-approved TRR.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.95pt; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin: 0 18.7pt 0 64.8pt; line-height: 104%; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;As of December 31, 2025 and 2024, Morongo's TRBA adjustment corresponds to an account receivable of $5,252,393 and 1,773,388 respectively. The TRBA is calculated annually and submitted&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;to&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;FERC&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;on&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;December&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;1,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;based&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;on&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;balance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;TRR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;as&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;September&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;30&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;will be effective in the TRR of January 1 of the subsequent year. As of December 31, 2025 and 2024, the amount used for the TRBA calculation was the last the FERC-approved TRR amounting to&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.2pt; margin-left: 64.8pt; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;$51,378,013&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.4pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.3pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$45,850,589&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.3pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;respectively.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin: 10.55pt 27.7pt 0 64.8pt; line-height: 104%; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;On&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;December&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;1,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;2025,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Morongo&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;filed&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;its&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;TRBA&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;adjustment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;for&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;2026&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;in&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Docket&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;No.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;ER26-634-000 requesting a base TRR revenue requirement of $50,323,829. In this filing, Morongo identified corrections to prior TRBAA computations and proposed revised TRBAA calculations. A FERC order was issued on April 9, 2026 regarding Docket No. ER26-634-000, accepting the revised TRBAA calculations, effective for service rendered on and after January 1, 2026.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 10.2pt; margin-left: 64.8pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-indent: -21.9pt; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic"&gt;(ii)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 10.8pt; font: 7pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic"&gt;Accrued&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic; letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic"&gt;interests&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic; letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic"&gt;on&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic; letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic; letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;TRBA&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin: 5.5pt 27.7pt 0 64.8pt; line-height: 104%; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;Interest&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;is&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;calculated&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;on&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;TRBA&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;in&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;accordance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.25pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;with&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;FERC&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;regulation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;35.19a&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;for&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;each&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;month&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;of the period January through December, and such interest is fully amortized over the 12-month period commencing in January.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin: 10.15pt 21.1pt 0 64.8pt; line-height: 104%; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;The TRBA and the interest form together the Transmission Revenue Balancing Account Adjustment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;(&amp;quot;TRBAA&amp;quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;or&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;quot;True-Up&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;adjustment&amp;quot;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.25pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;which&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.25pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;adjusts&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;TRR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;amount&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;effective&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;January&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;1 of the subsequent year (i.e. January 1, 2026) and will be recovered through the CAISO rate in &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;2026.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 10.15pt; margin-left: 64.8pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-indent: -24.15pt; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic"&gt;(iii)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 10.82pt; font: 7pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic"&gt;Transfer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic; letter-spacing: -0.25pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic"&gt;capability&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic; letter-spacing: -0.25pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic"&gt;regulatory&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic; letter-spacing: -0.25pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic; letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;asset&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 5.5pt; margin-left: 64.8pt; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;The&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.25pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Company&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;has&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;entered&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;into&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;a&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;lease&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;agreement&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;for&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;a&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;portion&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Transfer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Capability&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.25pt"&gt;the&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin: 0.55pt 18.7pt 0 64.8pt; line-height: 104%; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;48-corridor&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;miles&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;new&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;double-circuit&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;220&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;kV&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;transmission&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;line&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;appurtenant&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.25pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;facilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.25pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;with&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;SCE on July 12, 2021. The Agreement has a term of 30 years.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.5pt; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 9.5pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;table cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="margin-left: 64.65pt; border-collapse: collapse" class="e-rte-table"&gt; 				&lt;tr style="height: 15.75pt"&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 268.55pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 9pt"&gt; 							&lt;span style="font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 95.1pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-right: 6.3pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: right; line-height: 10.55pt"&gt; 							&lt;span style="width: 28.1pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Lucida Console&amp;quot;; font-size: 9.5pt; font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 9.5pt; font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline; letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;2025&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 26.77pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Lucida Console&amp;quot;; font-size: 9.5pt; font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 84.9pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-left: 6.45pt; margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 10.55pt"&gt; 		