n&gt;&lt;span&gt;assets&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;are&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;amortized&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;when&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;recovered&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;through&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;TRR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;in&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;subsequent &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;year.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 10.05pt; margin-left: 64.8pt; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;1.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: 1.75pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Morongo's&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;excess&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;managing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;administering&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;costs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;over&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;filing&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin: 10.55pt 21.1pt 0 82.8pt; line-height: 104%; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;The costs for managing and administering the Transfer Capability is to be updated annually through Morongo's formula rate filed with FERC to reflect the actual costs incurred by Morongo. The purpose is to ensure that all transmission revenue credits and adjustments for any&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.3pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;over-or&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.3pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;under-recovery&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.3pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.35pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;its&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;annual&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.45pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;TRR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.35pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.4pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;CAISO&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.35pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;tariff,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.3pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;flow&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.3pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;through&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.3pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;to&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;transmission customers creating a regulatory asset or a regulatory liability.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 10.25pt; margin-left: 82.8pt; margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 104%; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;Recoverable expenses amounting to $1,056,254 and $452,126 are included in the True-Up adjustment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.35pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;FY2025&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.3pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;effective&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.3pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;as&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.3pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.35pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;January&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;1,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.3pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;2027&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.25pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.3pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;FY2024&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.25pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;effective&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.35pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;as&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.4pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;January&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.25pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;2026 respectively and will be recovered throughout 2027 and 2026 respectively.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;h2 style="margin-top: 10.05pt; margin-left: 28.65pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-indent: -17.9pt; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.05pt"&gt;(5)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 5.68pt; font: 7pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span