"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: 0.75pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: 0.75pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline; letter-spacing: 4pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline"&gt;511,785,701&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline; letter-spacing: 4pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 26.13pt; text-indent: 0; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline; letter-spacing: 4pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline; letter-spacing: 4pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline"&gt;524,897,974&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline; letter-spacing: 2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 1pt; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-left: 28.75pt; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-style: italic"&gt;Term &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-style: italic; letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;loans&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin: 5.5pt 19.65pt 0 28.75pt; line-height: 104%; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;In July 2021, the Company entered into a note purchase agreement that comprises a term loan under the form&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Series&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;A&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Senior&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Secured&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Notes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;(&amp;quot;Initial&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Notes&amp;quot;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Series&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;B&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Senior&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Secured&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Notes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;(&amp;quot;Delayed&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Draw Notes&amp;quot;), together the (&amp;quot;Term Loans&amp;quot;). The Initial Notes have been issued at the closing of the Option on July 12, 2021 bearing an annual interest rate of 3.32%, whilst the Delayed Draw Notes have been issued on March 30, 2022 bearing and annual interest rate of 3.44% with the same term as the Initial Notes. The capital and interest amount of the Term Loans is repayable in quarterly installments to its 23 and 20 note holders&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;respectively&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.05pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;commencing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.05pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;September&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.05pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;30,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;2021&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.05pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;for&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.05pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.05pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Initial&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Notes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.05pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.05pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;commencing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.05pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;June&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;30,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;2022 for the Delayed Draw Notes, and matures on July 12, 2051. The Company is subject to distribution conditions, including a debt service coverage ratio and obtaining the FERC Order Confirming TRR. The Company is compliant with all covenant requirements as of December 31, 2025.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin: 10.45pt 21.75pt 0 28.75pt; line-height: 104%; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;In&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;July&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.05pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;2021,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Company&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;entered&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.05pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;into&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;a&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.05pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;letter&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.05pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;credit&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;reimbursement&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;agreement&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;in&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.05pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;which&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.05pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.05pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Company has requested that from time to time one or more letters of credits were issued in an aggregate principal not exceeding $15,509,029 in 2025 and 2024. A Debt Service Reserve letter of credit (&amp;quot;DSR Letter of Credit&amp;quot;) was issued totaling $15,509,029 in 2025 and $15,509,029 in 2024. The Company pays a commitment fee computed at a rate per annum equal to 0.30% on the aggregate daily average unutilized amount of the commitment amount. The Company also pays a letter of credit fee of 1% with respect to its participation in letters of credit which shall accrue at a rate per annum equal to the applicable margin for Eurodollar&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.05pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;loans,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;on&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.05pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.05pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;average&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.05pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;daily&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;amount&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.05pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;letter&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.05pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;credit's&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.05pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;exposure.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;The&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.05pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Eurodollar&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.05pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;loans&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.05pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;shall bear&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.25pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;interest&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;at&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;a&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;rate&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;per&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;annum&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;equal&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;to&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;adjusted&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;LIBO&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;rate&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;plus&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;applicable&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;margin&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;for&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt; Eurodollar&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin: 0 18.7pt 0 28.75pt; line-height: 104%; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;loans.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;These&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;fees&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;are&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;due&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;payable&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;in&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;arrears&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;on&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;a&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;quarterly&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;basis.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Expenses&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;totaling&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$231,879&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;in&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;2025 and $158,536 in 2024 were incurred with regards to these letters of credit and have been claimed through the True-up FY2025. It was therefore recorded as Regulatory assets in the accompanying Balance Sheet.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 10.15pt; margin-left: 28.75pt; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;As&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;at&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;December&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.05pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;31,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;2025,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.05pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;fair&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;value&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;long-term&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.05pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;debt&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;is&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.05pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;$405,664,855.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;h2 style="margin-top: 10.55pt; margin-left: 28.65pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-indent: -17.9pt; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.05pt"&gt;(8)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 5.68pt; font: 7pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Deferred&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.25pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Financing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;Costs&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/h2&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin: 5.45pt 21.1pt 0 28.75pt; line-height: 104%; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;The following represents the deferred financing costs, which are costs incurred by the Company in obtaining its financing prior the exercise of the Option. The costs are being amortized using the effective interest method over the life of the related debt and is included in interest expenses on long-term debt in the accompanying Statements of Operations. Only the portion filed for the Capital Cost Revenue Requirement&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.25pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;portion&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;TRR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;amounting&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$3,949,373,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;has&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;been&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;capitalized&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;against&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;debt,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;excess of financing costs have been capitalized under regulatory asset, refer to Note 4 for further details.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.3pt; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 9pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;table cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="margin-left: 29.1pt; border-collapse: collapse" class="e-rte-table"&gt; 				&lt;tr style="height: 14.85pt"&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 262.8pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; page-break-after: avoid; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 							&lt;span style="font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 126.25pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-right: 6.15pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: right; page-break-after: avoid; line-height: 10.8pt"&gt; 							&lt;span style="width: 27.1pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Lucida Console&amp;quot;; font-size: 9.5pt; font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160