t;&lt;span style="font-size: 9.5pt"&gt;costs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 9.5pt; letter-spacing: 1.35pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 9.5pt"&gt;at&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 9.5pt; letter-spacing: 1.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 9.5pt"&gt;year&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 9.5pt; letter-spacing: 2.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 9.5pt; letter-spacing: -0.25pt"&gt;end&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 126.25pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 3.6pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: right; page-break-after: avoid; line-height: 9.95pt"&gt; 							&lt;span style="font-size: 9.5pt"&gt;$ &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 24.03pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Lucida Console&amp;quot;; font-size: 9.5pt; text-decoration: underline; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 9.5pt; text-decoration: underline; letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;2,786,585&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 9.5pt; text-decoration: underline; letter-spacing: 2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 84.7pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 3.6pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: right; page-break-after: avoid; line-height: 9.95pt"&gt; 							&lt;span style="font-size: 9.5pt; text-decoration: underline"&gt;$&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 17.57pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Lucida Console&amp;quot;; font-size: 9.5pt; text-decoration: underline; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 9.5pt; text-decoration: underline; letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;2,988,411&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 9.5pt; text-decoration: underline; letter-spacing: 2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 				&lt;/tr&gt; 			&lt;/table&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 1pt; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;h2 style="margin-top: 0; margin-left: 28.65pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-indent: -17.9pt; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.05pt"&gt;(9)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 5.68pt; font: 7pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Members'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.4pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;Equity&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/h2&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin: 5.5pt 21.75pt 0 28.75pt; line-height: 104%; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;Net income or net loss and each item of income, gain, loss and deduction entering into the computation thereof, for each fiscal year shall be allocated among the Members (and credited and debited to their capital accounts) so as, to the extent possible, each Member's capital account balance, as increased by the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;amount&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;such&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Member's&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;share&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;partnership&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;minimum&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;gain&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;amount&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;such&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Member's&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;share of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.05pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;partner nonrecourse debt&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.05pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;minimum&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.05pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;gain,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.05pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;to&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.05pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;equal the amount&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.05pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;that&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.05pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;would be distributed to such Member if the Company sold all of its assets for their book value in cash, paid all of its liabilities and distributed its cash to its Members in complete liquidation.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin: 10.3pt 18.7pt 0 28.75pt; line-height: 104%; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;After&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;giving&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;effect&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;to&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;withdrawals&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;transfers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;from&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;revenue&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;account&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;to&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;service&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.25pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;long-term debt and suppliers, an amount equal to the funds remaining in the revenue account on such payment date will be transferred to the distribution account to be distributed in 2025 to Morongo Band. Prior to June 18, 2024, funds remaining in the revenue account on such payment dates were distributed to Morongo Band (51%) and Coachella Partners (49%).&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin: 10.25pt 21.1pt 0 28.75pt; line-height: 104%; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;Profit, losses and distributions are allocated in accordance with the provisions of the Company's Limited Liability agreement. During 2022, the Company started to make distributions of excess operating cash flows to the Members amounting to $181,806,929. A resolution was issued and signed by the Members acknowledging&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;that&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;making&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;distribution&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;is&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;in&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;best&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;interests&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Company&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;its&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;stakeholders&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;and that after giving effect to the distribution the fair value of the assets of the Company (including, the Company's rights under the Transfer Capability Lease, by and between SCE and the Company and the Company's Transmission Owner Tarriff) will exceed the liabilities of the Company.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.95pt; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-left: 28.75pt; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;During&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.35pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;2025,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.3pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.3pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;distributions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.25pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;amounted&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.35pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;to&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.25pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$4,934,538&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.3pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.25pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$7,264,656&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.3pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;in&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.25pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;2024.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.3pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Capital&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.3pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;contributions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.25pt"&gt;of&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.5pt; margin-left: 28.75pt; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;$3,883,216&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;were&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;received&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;in&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;2025.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;h2 style="margin-top: 10.55pt; margin-left: 28.65pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-indent: -17.9pt; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.05pt"&gt;(10)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 0.12pt; font: 7pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Transmission&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.35pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;Revenue&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/h2&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin: 5.45pt 18.7pt 0 28.75pt; line-height: 104%; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;The Company is a Participating Transmission Owner (&amp;quot;PTO&amp;quot;) of the CAISO and submitted to FERC a proposed 2025 annual Transmission Owner's Tarriff (&amp;quot;TO Tarriff&amp;quot;) amounting to $51,378,013 and 45,850,589&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;in&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;2024&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;to&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;be&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;charged&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;to&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;CAISO&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;for&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Morongo's&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;leasehold&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;interest&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;in&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Transfer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Capability of the Project for the period from January 1 to December 31, 2025. The TRR is paid by the CAISO to Morongo through the CAISO's collection of Transmission Access Charge rates for transmission service provided to the CAISO's customers. The TRR is recognized on a monthly basis when the right to receive payments is established.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.4pt; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 9pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;table cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="margin-left: 28.7pt; border-collapse: collapse" class="e-rte-table"&gt; 				&lt;tr style="height: 11.2pt"&gt; 					&lt;td colspan="3" style="width: 398.3pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-right: 6.4pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: right; line-height: 10.2pt"&gt; 							&lt;span style="width: 27.6pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Lucida Console&amp;quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline; letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;2025&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 27.55pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Lucida Console&amp;quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 86.45pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-right: 2.3pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: right; line-height: 10.2pt"&gt; 							&lt;span style="width: 27.6pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Lucida Console&amp;quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline; letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;2024&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 27.55pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Lucida Console&amp;quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 				&lt;/tr&gt; 				&lt;tr style="height: 21.2pt"&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 262.25pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 9.05pt; margin-left: 2.5pt; margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 11.15pt"&gt; 							&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;Annual&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; letter-spacing: -0.6pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;capital&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; letter-spacing: -0.6pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;cost&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;revenue&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; letter-spacing: -0.45pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;requirement&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td colspan="2" style="width: 136.05pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 9.05pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: right; line-height: 11.15pt"&gt; 							&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; letter-spacing: -0.5pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; letter-spacing: -0.5pt"&gt;$&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;37,221,669&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 86.45pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 9.05pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: right; line-height: 11.15pt"&gt; 							&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;$&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;37,221,669&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 				&lt;/tr&gt; 				&lt;tr style="height: 11.85pt"&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 262.25pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.35pt; margin-left: 2.5pt; margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 10.5pt"&gt; 							&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;Annual&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; letter-spacing: -0.5pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;operating&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; letter-spacing: -0.35pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;capital&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; letter-spacing: -0.5pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;cost revenue&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; letter-spacing: -0.35pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;requirement&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td colspan="2" style="width: 136.05pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.35pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: right; line-height: 10.5pt"&gt; 							&lt;span style="width: 70.65pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Lucida Console&amp;quot;; font-size: 10pt; text-decoration: underline; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; text-decoration: underline; letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;14,156,344&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; text-decoration: underline; letter-spacing: 2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 86.45pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.35pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: right; line-height: 10.5pt"&gt; 							&lt;span style="width: 24.1pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Lucida Console&amp;quot;; font-size: 10pt; text-decoration: underline; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; text-decoration: underline; letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;8,628,920&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; text-decoration: underline; letter-spacing: 2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 				&lt;/tr&gt; 				&lt;tr style="height: 20.05pt"&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 262.25pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 8.55pt; margin-left: 2.5pt; margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 10.5pt"&gt; 							&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt"&gt;PTO's&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt"&gt;Base&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; letter-spacing: -0.25pt"&gt;TRR&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 37.55pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 8.55pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: right; line-height: 10.5pt"&gt; 							&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 98.5pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 8.55pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: right; line-height: 10.5pt"&gt; 							&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; text-decoration: underline; letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;$&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; text-decoration: underline; letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; text-decoration: underline; letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;51,378,013&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 86.45pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 8.55pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: right; line-height: 10.5pt"&gt; 							&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; text-decoration: underline; letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;$&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; text-decoration: underline; letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; text-decoration: underline; letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;45,850,589&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 				&lt;/tr&gt; 			&lt;/table&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 9.45pt; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin: 0 18.15pt 0 28.75pt; line-height: 104%; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;The annual Capital Cost Revenue Requirement is the lower of Morongo's costs of leasing the Transfer Capability including the all-in SCE authorized Return&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;on Equity (ROE) or the SCE Representative Rate&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.05pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;that is&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;rate&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;that&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;SCE&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;would&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;charge&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;on&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;a&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;levelized&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;30-year&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;basis&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;in&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;lieu&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Morongo's&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;leasehold&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;interest&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;which is capped at $37,221,669. It is a fixed amount for the lease term of 30 years.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin: 10.2pt 18.7pt 0 28.75pt; line-height: 104%; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;The annual Operating Capital Cost Revenue Requirement is composed of two elements: (1) the estimated annual&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.05pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;O&amp;amp;M-related&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;costs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;incurred by SCE,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.05pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;filed in&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.05pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;its own TO&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.05pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Tarriff&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.05pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;with&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.05pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;FERC, attributable to Morongo's portion of the Project, estimated to $14,156,344 in 2025 and $8,628,920 in 2024 and (2) the costs directly incurred&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;by&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Company&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;in&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;managing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;administrating&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Transfer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Capability&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.25pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;estimated&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;to&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.25pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$210,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;for 2025 and $210,000 2024. Both expenses are true-up on an annual basis based on actual expenses incurred and reflected in the subsequent year TRR.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;h2 style="margin-top: 10.4pt; margin-left: 28.8pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-indent: -18pt; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.05pt"&gt;(11)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 0.07pt; font: 7pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt; Income Taxes:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 7.1pt; text-indent: 0; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 36pt; text-indent: 0; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 36pt; text-indent: 0; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 36pt; text-indent: 0; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 36pt; text-indent: 0; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 36pt; text-indent: 0; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 36pt; text-indent: 0; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 36pt; text-indent: 0; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 36pt; text-indent: 0; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 36pt; text-indent: 0; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/h2&gt; 			&lt;h2 style="margin-top: 10.4pt; margin-left: 28.8pt; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-weight: normal"&gt;Our effective tax rate varied from the statutory federal income tax rate due to differences between the book and tax treatment of various transactions as follows:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: normal"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/h2&gt; 			&lt;h2 style="margin-top: 10.4pt; margin-left: 28.8pt; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span style="width: 7.2pt; font-weight: normal; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 36pt; font-weight: normal; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 36pt; font-weight: normal; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/h2&gt; 			&lt;table cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="width: 498.35pt; margin-left: 28.65pt; border: 0.75pt solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); border-collapse: collapse; height: 290px" class="e-rte-table"&gt; 				&lt;tr style="height: 7.24138%"&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 316.85pt; border-right: 0.75pt solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); border-bottom: 0.75pt solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;h2 style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: center; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 							&lt;span style="font-weight: normal"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/h2&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 89.25pt; border-right: 0.75pt solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); border-left: 0.75pt solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); border-bottom: 0.75pt solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;h2 style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; t