has been placed in service under the operational control of CAISO.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin: 4.7pt 30.7pt 0 64.8pt; text-indent: -18.05pt; line-height: 101%; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11pt"&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 12.57pt; font: 7pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;On&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;August&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;11,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;2021&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;in&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Docket&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;ER21-669-003,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Morongo&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;submitted&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;a&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Settlement&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;to&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;fully&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;fairly resolve all issues for hearing in Docket ER21-669-000 and ER21-669-001 by establishing a just and reasonable ROE by