ts&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;TO&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Tarriff&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;TRR.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin: 5.4pt 39.65pt 0 64.8pt; text-indent: -18.05pt; line-height: 97%; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11pt"&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 12.57pt; font: 7pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;On&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;March&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;3,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.25pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;2021,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;FERC&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;has&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;accepted&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;suspended&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;filing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Morongo's&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;TO&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Tarriff&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;and made effective, subject to refund and hearing and settlement judge procedure and TRR.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin: 5.15pt 20.8pt 0 64.8pt; text-indent: -18.05pt; line-height: 103%; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11pt"&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 12.57pt; font: 7pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;On&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;December&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;1,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;2023,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Morongo&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;submitted&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;its&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;TO&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Tarriff&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;with&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;True-Up&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;mechanism&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;to&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;reflect&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;the Annual operating Cost Transmission Revenue Requirement (TRR) update in for its leasehold interest in the Project (exclusive of SCE billed) amounting to $8,628,920 to become effective January 1, 2024, in Docket ER24-519-000. The amount comprises $7,590,394 in SCE operating costs and $1,038,525 in managing and administering its Transfer Capability. The proposed Base TRR FY2024 amounted to $45,850,589. On January 22, 2024, the TRBAA filing ER24-520-000 was accepted, increasing the TRR by $2,208,010. The final TRR effective for rate year 2024 was&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.2pt; margin-left: 64.8pt; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;$48,058,599.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin: 4.95pt 20.8pt 0 64.8pt; text-indent: -18.05pt; line-height: 103%; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11pt"&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 12.57pt; font: 7pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;On&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;December&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;2,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;2024,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Morongo&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;submitted&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;its&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;TO&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Tarriff&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;with&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;True-Up&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;mechanism&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;to&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;reflect&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;the Annual operating Cost Transmission Revenue Requirement (TRR) update in for its leasehold interest in the Project (exclusive of SCE billed) amounting to $14,156,344 to become effective January 1, 2025, in Docket ER25-609-000. The amount comprises $11,785,000 in SCE operating costs and $2,371,344 in managing and administering its Transfer Capability. The proposed Base TRR FY2025 amounted to $51,378,013. On January 22, 2024, the TRBAA filing ER25-608-000 was accepted, increasing the TRR by $1,773,388. The final TRR effective for rate year 2025 was&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.25pt; margin-left: 64.8pt; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;$53,151,401.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin: 5pt 19.65pt 0 64.8pt; text-indent: -18.05pt; line-height: 103%; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11pt"&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 12.57pt; font: 7pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Rate Year 2025 - On December 2, 2024, Morongo filed an update to its TRBAA from $2,208,010 to&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$1,773,388,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;which&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;represents&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;an&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;under-collection&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Morongo&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Transmission's&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;TRR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;for&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.25pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;period October 1, 2023 through September 30, 2024. Morongo proposed the revised TRBAA to become effective January 1, 2025,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.05pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;and was accepted by the Commission on December 23, 2024 in&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.05pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Docket No. ER25-608-000.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin: 4.35pt 20.8pt 0 64.8pt; text-indent: -18.05pt; line-height: 103%; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11pt"&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 12.57pt; font: 7pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;On&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;December&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;1,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;2025,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Morongo&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;submitted&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;its&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;TO&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Tarriff&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;with&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;True-Up&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;mechanism&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;to&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;reflect&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;the Annual operating Cost Transmission Revenue Requirement (TRR) update in for its leasehold interest in the Project (exclusive of SCE billed) amounting to $13,102,160 to become effective January 1, 2026 in Docket ER26-642-000. The amount comprises $12,057,545 in SCE operating costs and $1,044,615 in managing and administering its Transfer Capability. The proposed Base TRR FY2026 amounts to $50,323,829. On December 2, 2025, the TRBAA update was filed in ER26-634-000, increasing the TRR by $5,252,393. The final TRR effective for rate year 2026 is&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin: 0.2pt 18.7pt 0 64.8pt; line-height: 104%; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;$55,576,222&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;per&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;letter&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;order&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;issued&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;in&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Docket&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;No.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;ER26-634-000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;issued&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;on&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;April&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;9,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;2026, effective for service rendered on or after January 1, 2026.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;h3 style="margin-top: 10.1pt; margin-left: 46.7pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-indent